From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kadaxo <105596590+kadaxo@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 01:30:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Include <cstdlib> instead of <malloc.h>

<malloc.h> doesn't exist on macOS, and nothing from it is used here.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
diff --git a/src/standard_allocator.cpp b/src/standard_allocator.cpp
--- a/src/standard_allocator.cpp
+++ b/src/standard_allocator.cpp
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
 #include "../include/standard_allocator.h"
 
-#include <malloc.h>
+#include <cstdlib>
 
 piranha::StandardAllocator *piranha::StandardAllocator::s_global = nullptr;
 
